      "hints": [
        "Focus on how currents are balanced at a junction in a circuit.",
        "Express the rule by comparing the total current entering a junction with the total current leaving it."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Kirchhoff's first law applies at a circuit junction.",
        "The sum of the currents entering the junction equals the sum of the currents leaving the junction.",
        "Equivalently, the algebraic sum of currents at a junction is zero."
      ],
