      "walkthrough": [
        "The terminal potential difference is 4.4 V and the e.m.f. is 12.0 V.",
        "Use 12.0 = 4.4 + 3.6r, where 3.6r is the potential difference across the internal resistance.",
        "Rearranging gives r = (12.0 - 4.4) / 3.6 = 2.1 ohm."
      ],
